WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:34.450
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:34.720 --> 01:36.240
Just leave it at the door. Thank you.

3
01:36.240 --> 01:38.240
It'll go bad if I leave it at the door.

4
01:41.840 --> 01:42.479
Dad.

5
01:42.880 --> 01:43.479
Hurry.

6
01:43.880 --> 01:44.940
They're all fresh.

7
01:45.200 --> 01:46.280
Why are you here?

8
01:47.560 --> 01:48.479
Change your shoes.

9
01:48.479 --> 01:50.560
You haven't visited me for days.

10
01:50.560 --> 01:52.200
I thought I'd come see you.

11
01:52.759 --> 01:54.000
What do you mean?

12
01:54.000 --> 01:55.080
I was just there the day before yesterday.

13
01:55.080 --> 01:55.560
We even put things

14
01:55.560 --> 01:57.160
in the fridge together.

15
02:00.200 --> 02:02.440
What? Am I not welcome here?

16
02:02.440 --> 02:03.440
What are you talking about?

17
02:03.440 --> 02:05.120
Of course you're welcome.

18
02:05.200 --> 02:06.660
I asked you to come before,

19
02:06.720 --> 02:07.720
but you wouldn't.

20
02:07.880 --> 02:09.320
I mean, if you want to come,

21
02:09.320 --> 02:10.120
just give me a call,

22
02:10.120 --> 02:11.250
and I'll pick you up.

23
02:11.760 --> 02:12.440
No need.

24
02:13.000 --> 02:15.130
You've tidied up this room quite well.

25
02:16.000 --> 02:17.200
It's just a bit empty.

26
02:17.640 --> 02:19.400
How about I write some calligraphy for you?

27
02:19.400 --> 02:21.160
Look, hang it there, or there.

28
02:21.560 --> 02:22.690
It would be perfect.

29
02:23.720 --> 02:24.600
Sure, Dad.

30
02:25.040 --> 02:27.480
But I'll hang it in my office later.

31
02:28.280 --> 02:29.480
Hang it in the office?

32
02:29.720 --> 02:31.560
Okay, the office is fine too.

33
02:31.760 --> 02:33.480
I wrote the one in Xiaolong's office.

34
02:33.480 --> 02:33.920
Right.

35
02:33.920 --> 02:35.240
The 'Sword of Justice'.

36
02:35.240 --> 02:37.170
She hung it in a very obvious place.

37
02:38.600 --> 02:40.200
How's your health recently?

38
02:42.400 --> 02:43.280
I mean...

39
02:43.760 --> 02:45.640
Have you been going to rehab lately?

40
02:45.640 --> 02:46.680
I used to go all the time.

41
02:46.680 --> 02:49.000
I've been too busy these past couple of days.

42
02:49.000 --> 02:51.120
I'll go again after I finish this case.

43
02:51.120 --> 02:52.360
What case are you busy with?

44
02:52.360 --> 02:53.560
It's still the same case as before.

45
02:53.560 --> 02:55.360
The one with Xiaolong, Wangang.

46
02:56.280 --> 02:57.540
Speaking of Xiaolong,

47
02:58.480 --> 03:00.280
I have to say a few more words.

48
03:01.000 --> 03:03.640
You need to get along well with her.

49
03:03.960 --> 03:05.520
Don't always make her mad.

50
03:05.600 --> 03:07.400
That really hurts the relationship.

51
03:07.400 --> 03:09.120
I didn't make her mad. We...

52
03:09.120 --> 03:10.280
Okay, I understand.

53
03:10.920 --> 03:11.840
And also,

54
03:13.840 --> 03:15.700
I'm just saying, you're a lawyer.

55
03:16.320 --> 03:17.720
The scale in your heart

56
03:18.280 --> 03:19.540
must be kept balanced.

57
03:19.800 --> 03:22.130
If there's really a problem with Wangang,

58
03:22.640 --> 03:24.640
you absolutely must not cover it up.

59
03:27.680 --> 03:29.079
Dad, I need to take a call.

60
03:29.200 --> 03:30.530
Please sit for a moment.

61
03:33.160 --> 03:34.160
Hello, Lanya.

62
03:39.160 --> 03:40.760
You and Su Bowen look at this.

63
03:45.000 --> 03:45.600
Sure.

64
03:54.680 --> 03:55.640
Are you leaving?

65
03:55.640 --> 03:56.520
I'm going back.

66
03:56.520 --> 03:57.200
Why are you going back?

67
03:57.200 --> 03:58.520
Let's have a meal together.

68
03:58.520 --> 03:59.720
No, you're busy.

69
04:01.000 --> 04:02.800
By the way, you always stay up late.

70
04:02.800 --> 04:04.720
I brought you some liver protection tablets

71
04:04.720 --> 04:05.560
and Vitamin C.

72
04:05.960 --> 04:07.220
Remember to take them.

73
04:07.920 --> 04:08.520
Okay, I'm leaving.

74
04:08.520 --> 04:09.680
No, wait.

75
04:09.680 --> 04:10.840
Don't rush. I'll get my car keys.

76
04:10.840 --> 04:11.440
I'll drive you back. Don't...

77
04:11.440 --> 04:14.040
You don't need to drive me. I'll just walk back.

78
04:21.680 --> 04:23.280
Longfor Intelligent Living

79
04:49.480 --> 04:50.760
Develop a resort?

80
04:50.960 --> 04:51.520
Yes.

81
04:51.840 --> 04:52.840
Wangang said

82
04:52.880 --> 04:55.080
our place has beautiful scenery,

83
04:55.080 --> 04:57.280
and they plan to focus on developing it.

84
04:57.640 --> 04:58.840
Five-star hotels,

85
04:59.000 --> 05:01.360
boutique B&Bs, and ecological scenic spots

86
05:01.360 --> 05:02.560
will all be included.

87
05:04.400 --> 05:05.160
Director Ma,

88
05:06.040 --> 05:08.160
I just said we need to test the groundwater,

89
05:08.160 --> 05:09.480
and they offered to develop a resort.

90
05:09.480 --> 05:11.720
Don't you think it's fishy?

91
05:11.880 --> 05:14.120
It seems like a windfall,

92
05:14.120 --> 05:16.440
but it's very likely a trap.

93
05:16.440 --> 05:19.000
We must hurry up and test the groundwater.

94
05:19.000 --> 05:20.530
That won't do, Lawyer Xiao.

95
05:20.640 --> 05:21.760
Wangang said

96
05:21.760 --> 05:23.880
if problems are found in our land,

97
05:24.080 --> 05:25.280
they won't want it.

98
05:25.280 --> 05:27.440
Who will bear the loss then?

99
05:29.480 --> 05:31.210
What about the sick villagers?

100
05:31.760 --> 05:32.720
Besides,

101
05:32.720 --> 05:34.360
a big company like Wangang,

102
05:34.560 --> 05:37.290
wouldn't they test the land before acquiring it?

103
05:37.480 --> 05:40.520
If they still acquire it even if the groundwater has problems,

104
05:40.520 --> 05:42.960
doesn't it show they have something to hide?

105
05:42.960 --> 05:43.720
Lawyer Xiao,

106
05:44.200 --> 05:46.800
this development opportunity is really rare.

107
05:47.080 --> 05:48.760
If this resort is built,

108
05:48.760 --> 05:49.800
we'll have money

109
05:49.800 --> 05:52.280
to treat the sick villagers,

110
05:52.280 --> 05:53.040
right?

111
05:55.920 --> 05:57.680
Director Ma said it well.

112
05:59.400 --> 06:02.480
Caring about the villagers' welfare and the big picture.

113
06:02.480 --> 06:03.240
Impressive.

114
06:03.240 --> 06:04.240
Sit down, please.

115
06:04.400 --> 06:05.880
Well, Lawyer Xiao.

116
06:06.680 --> 06:09.240
I know you just want to test the groundwater.

117
06:09.240 --> 06:10.720
I've already done it for you.

118
06:10.720 --> 06:12.400
Here is the test report.

119
06:12.440 --> 06:14.500
It didn't cost much. You're welcome.

120
06:15.720 --> 06:17.760
Everyone, the report is out.

121
06:18.080 --> 06:20.600
All indicators in our village are normal.

122
06:20.600 --> 06:21.480
Rest assured.

123
06:22.840 --> 06:24.960
How can we rest assured?

124
06:24.960 --> 06:27.040
A test report from such a small company,

125
06:27.040 --> 06:28.400
we don't even know if they are qualified.

126
06:28.400 --> 06:29.520
How can we trust it?

127
06:29.560 --> 06:31.040
Only a report from an official authoritative institution

128
06:31.040 --> 06:32.400
is valid.

129
06:32.400 --> 06:33.400
Believe it or not.

130
06:33.920 --> 06:34.880
No, Lawyer Xiao.

131
06:35.320 --> 06:36.650
Who do you think you are?

132
06:37.040 --> 06:38.840
This is Fuyuan Village's own business.

133
06:38.840 --> 06:40.640
Why are you always interfering?

134
06:41.000 --> 06:43.130
Can't you stand seeing others do well?

135
06:43.400 --> 06:45.530
Or maybe you're doing this on purpose,

136
06:45.800 --> 06:49.060
deliberately questioning Lawyer Li's development plan.

137
06:56.040 --> 06:56.970
What do you mean?

138
06:57.240 --> 06:59.040
The plan is Lawyer Li's.

139
07:03.320 --> 07:04.780
You came up with this plan.

140
07:05.880 --> 07:06.520
Mr. Wan.

141
07:07.960 --> 07:09.400
I do have a solution.

142
07:12.400 --> 07:13.800
Develop Fuyuan Village.

143
07:14.040 --> 07:15.240
Turn it into a resort.

144
07:16.240 --> 07:18.440
Take the initiative into our own hands.

145
07:28.960 --> 07:30.690
Director Ma, what should we do?

146
07:35.120 --> 07:36.720
Tell me, what does this mean?

147
07:37.520 --> 07:39.850
Is this the result of your consideration?

148
07:42.159 --> 07:42.880
Li Xin.

149
07:43.520 --> 07:45.520
Do you know that what you are doing now

150
07:45.520 --> 07:48.050
is beyond the professional scope of a lawyer?

151
07:48.120 --> 07:50.320
You are covering up a crime for someone.

152
07:50.520 --> 07:53.360
How many perfectly healthy people are left in this village?

153
07:53.360 --> 07:54.720
And those who have passed away.

154
07:54.720 --> 07:56.800
Those were living human lives.

155
07:56.880 --> 07:58.810
I can't explain it to you right now.

156
08:01.760 --> 08:02.920
I always thought

157
08:04.960 --> 08:05.840
that we

158
08:07.120 --> 08:09.780
just had different understandings of justice,

159
08:10.280 --> 08:12.140
but we still had our bottom lines.

160
08:13.480 --> 08:15.140
I thought we were just rivals.

161
08:16.240 --> 08:18.040
I didn't expect us to be enemies.

162
08:22.840 --> 08:24.480
You really disappointed me.

163
08:45.320 --> 08:46.380
What are you doing?

164
08:47.400 --> 08:50.520
Well, my stomach hurts.

165
08:50.520 --> 08:51.920
I need to relieve myself.

166
08:52.200 --> 08:54.240
Are you with that female lawyer?

167
08:55.280 --> 08:56.120
What female lawyer?

168
08:56.120 --> 08:57.120
I don't know her.

169
08:57.280 --> 09:00.560
I'm a wilderness exploration blogger.

170
09:00.560 --> 09:01.920
I'm surviving in the wild here.

171
09:01.920 --> 09:02.960
Go back to your business.

172
09:02.960 --> 09:04.800
I have to go explore.

173
09:24.240 --> 09:25.480
Hello, Director Ma.

174
09:25.600 --> 09:26.360
Mr. Wan.

175
09:27.560 --> 09:30.120
We previously agreed on 300,000 per household.

176
09:30.120 --> 09:32.120
Could you offer a bit more?

177
09:32.440 --> 09:34.800
What? Are you raising the price on me?

178
09:35.240 --> 09:35.920
No, no, no.

179
09:36.440 --> 09:37.920
Mr. Wan, how would I dare?

180
09:38.240 --> 09:39.680
It's all because of that female lawyer.

181
09:39.680 --> 09:41.800
She's stirring things up in the village,

182
09:41.800 --> 09:43.480
saying Wangang's resort development

183
09:43.480 --> 09:45.040
is driven by a guilty conscience.

184
09:45.040 --> 09:46.440
They're using this trick

185
09:46.480 --> 09:48.480
just to prevent us from testing.

186
09:48.760 --> 09:50.000
Let's think about it.

187
09:50.080 --> 09:52.400
Are our lives and health

188
09:52.600 --> 09:54.040
only worth 300,000?

189
09:54.160 --> 09:56.080
What about our deceased relatives,

190
09:56.080 --> 09:58.080
and our future children,

191
09:58.080 --> 09:59.320
and their children?

192
09:59.320 --> 10:00.650
What about their lives?

193
10:00.880 --> 10:02.280
What about their health?

194
10:02.400 --> 10:03.730
How much are they worth?

195
10:04.000 --> 10:06.400
If we can confirm that Wangang

196
10:06.680 --> 10:09.560
If they need to take responsibility for this pollution,

197
10:09.560 --> 10:11.520
the compensation they end up paying

198
10:11.520 --> 10:13.650
will likely be much more than 300,000.

199
10:15.760 --> 10:16.600
Really?

200
10:17.640 --> 10:20.000
With her doing this, people are unsettled.

201
10:20.000 --> 10:22.560
They say they won't sign unless more money is added.

202
10:22.560 --> 10:23.280
Lately,

203
10:23.280 --> 10:26.880
villagers have been coming to make trouble for me every few days.

204
10:27.360 --> 10:27.920
Mr. Wan.

205
10:28.200 --> 10:28.800
Mr. Wan.

206
10:32.360 --> 10:32.840
Brother.

207
10:32.840 --> 10:33.440
Come here.

208
10:35.560 --> 10:36.620
Listen carefully.

209
10:39.880 --> 10:40.610
Understood.

210
11:14.480 --> 11:16.160
Stop hiding. Come out.

211
11:20.920 --> 11:21.600
Tell me.

212
11:22.160 --> 11:24.220
Isn't this too much of a coincidence?

213
11:24.520 --> 11:27.160
I was wondering why there was always a dark shadow

214
11:27.160 --> 11:29.160
following me in and out lately.

215
11:30.120 --> 11:31.480
So you were stalking me.

216
11:31.760 --> 11:33.800
What do you mean stalking? That sounds awful.

217
11:33.800 --> 11:35.840
I... I was just...

218
11:37.040 --> 11:37.720
I...

219
11:41.120 --> 11:42.520
Protecting me in secret.

220
11:47.280 --> 11:48.720
Like a Dark Knight.

221
11:56.200 --> 11:57.120
Brother Hu,

222
11:57.560 --> 11:58.760
I...

223
12:00.120 --> 12:01.850
know what you're usually like,

224
12:02.600 --> 12:03.280
right?

225
12:05.320 --> 12:06.000
But in your heart,

226
12:06.000 --> 12:08.530
there must still be a little flame of justice.

227
12:10.520 --> 12:11.720
I just hope that

228
12:12.040 --> 12:13.360
no matter when,

229
12:14.360 --> 12:17.880
no matter how well-dressed you are,

230
12:19.160 --> 12:21.720
this little flame never goes out.

231
12:23.080 --> 12:23.880
Right. I know.

232
12:25.560 --> 12:26.120
I...

233
12:26.440 --> 12:28.400
I'm going home. Are you following?

234
12:29.120 --> 12:30.720
Following what? Just go.

235
12:32.720 --> 12:33.480
Ride safely.

236
13:50.440 --> 13:51.440
What happened?

237
13:51.560 --> 13:53.420
The doctor said it's a concussion

238
13:53.440 --> 13:55.160
and a hairline fracture in her arm.

239
13:55.160 --> 13:57.400
It's not life-threatening, but she needs to rest.

240
13:57.400 --> 13:57.720
No.

241
13:58.400 --> 13:59.930
The doctor won't let you in.

242
14:00.200 --> 14:01.680
What exactly happened with this car accident?

243
14:01.680 --> 14:04.520
The traffic police said the other party crashed into her,

244
14:04.520 --> 14:05.920
and then ran away.

245
14:05.920 --> 14:07.480
It seemed intentional.

246
14:08.760 --> 14:10.440
Blame me. It's actually my fault.

247
14:10.440 --> 14:12.160
I should have taken her back.

248
14:12.160 --> 14:14.820
If I were with her, this wouldn't have happened.

249
14:15.000 --> 14:15.720
Impossible.

250
14:15.720 --> 14:16.680
What do you mean?

251
14:18.400 --> 14:19.460
Where is Xiaolong?

252
14:19.920 --> 14:20.580
Godfather.

253
14:20.720 --> 14:21.760
Where? Here?

254
14:22.960 --> 14:23.600
Uncle Xiao,

255
14:23.600 --> 14:25.440
you can't go in. The patient needs to rest.

256
14:25.440 --> 14:26.440
Calm down.

257
14:26.960 --> 14:28.240
No, I want to see my daughter.

258
14:28.240 --> 14:29.320
Please go out first.

259
14:29.320 --> 14:30.240
Xiaolong is fine.

260
14:30.240 --> 14:31.370
Okay, okay, I'll go.

261
14:31.440 --> 14:33.880
Let her rest.

262
14:34.640 --> 14:36.160
Godfather, calm down.

263
14:36.240 --> 14:36.920
Who hit her?

264
14:36.920 --> 14:38.640
Who hit her? Where is the person?

265
14:38.640 --> 14:39.440
They ran away.

266
14:39.440 --> 14:40.440
How did they run away?

267
14:40.440 --> 14:42.600
Godfather, I understand how you feel right now,

268
14:42.600 --> 14:44.600
but Xiaolong needs you the most now.

269
14:44.680 --> 14:46.280
Let's wait for her to wake up.

270
14:48.520 --> 14:49.320
Then the doctor,

271
14:49.320 --> 14:50.650
what did the doctor say?

272
14:50.680 --> 14:51.760
It's okay.

273
14:51.880 --> 14:54.210
It's not life-threatening. Don't worry.

274
15:10.720 --> 15:12.120
Did you know it all along?

275
15:14.920 --> 15:17.320
I didn't want to believe it before.

276
15:19.400 --> 15:21.330
But after the law firm was smashed,

277
15:22.880 --> 15:24.010
she went to see Dali.

278
15:29.840 --> 15:30.570
You stay here

279
15:31.440 --> 15:33.170
and take good care of Xiaolong.

280
15:33.640 --> 15:34.770
Where are you going?

281
15:36.600 --> 15:38.200
Keep an eye on Uncle Xiao.

282
15:48.960 --> 15:49.890
Boss, it's done.

283
15:50.240 --> 15:51.480
After hitting that female lawyer,

284
15:51.480 --> 15:52.440
he's already hidden away.

285
15:52.440 --> 15:53.720
The money has been delivered.

286
15:53.720 --> 15:56.120
We'll arrange for him to go abroad tonight.

287
15:57.120 --> 15:58.440
Well done.

288
16:05.480 --> 16:06.240
Who is it?

289
16:06.880 --> 16:07.840
Go out first.

290
16:16.920 --> 16:18.650
Why are you so angry, Lawyer Li?

291
16:18.840 --> 16:19.920
What happened?

292
16:22.120 --> 16:23.000
Wan Zhuoli,

293
16:24.000 --> 16:25.640
or is your surname still Sun?

294
16:27.640 --> 16:29.840
If you keep acting up and cause trouble,

295
16:29.840 --> 16:33.370
do you think your father will give up everything to protect you?

296
16:33.560 --> 16:35.840
You're just your father's pawn.

297
16:35.840 --> 16:37.000
Being a pawn is good.

298
16:37.440 --> 16:39.160
I like being a pawn.

299
16:39.680 --> 16:42.480
I have food, drinks, and fun. It's great.

300
16:43.480 --> 16:45.000
Then be a good pawn.

301
16:45.480 --> 16:46.600
Save your own skin.

302
16:47.600 --> 16:50.520
Don't mess around until your father doesn't want you again.

303
16:50.520 --> 16:52.320
In the end, you'll have nothing,

304
16:52.480 --> 16:55.280
turning from a pawn back into a discarded piece.

305
16:57.680 --> 17:01.360
You bastard!

306
17:02.400 --> 17:03.040
Come on.

307
17:03.760 --> 17:04.560
Come on.

308
17:07.079 --> 17:07.940
You don't dare.

309
17:09.920 --> 17:12.050
I know everything you've done before.

310
17:12.079 --> 17:13.599
If you dare to touch Xiao Longnv again,

311
17:13.599 --> 17:14.839
I promise to make your life

312
17:14.839 --> 17:16.480
less comfortable than it is now.

313
17:16.480 --> 17:17.210
Understand?

314
17:40.640 --> 17:41.400
I'm back.

315
17:43.120 --> 17:44.250
Where is Uncle Xiao?

316
17:45.680 --> 17:47.600
He was just here.

317
17:47.600 --> 17:48.600
We chatted for a bit.

318
17:48.600 --> 17:50.600
Then he asked me to fetch some water.

319
17:56.760 --> 17:57.680
He hung up on me.

320
17:58.760 --> 18:00.560
Dong Beihu, what can you even do?

321
18:09.040 --> 18:11.240
Where is your boss, the one named Wan?

322
18:11.640 --> 18:12.480
I'm not sure.

323
18:13.640 --> 18:15.170
Where is your boss, Mr. Wan?

324
18:15.240 --> 18:15.970
I don't know.

325
18:32.880 --> 18:34.000
It's fine.

326
18:35.640 --> 18:37.900
Did you order someone to hit my daughter?

327
18:39.840 --> 18:40.640
I don't know.

328
18:41.320 --> 18:42.840
Who is your daughter?

329
18:42.840 --> 18:43.600
Xiao Longnü.

330
18:44.800 --> 18:45.680
Lawyer Xiao?

331
18:47.680 --> 18:48.520
Is she dead?

332
19:01.040 --> 19:02.100
What are you doing?

333
19:06.360 --> 19:07.160
I'll kill you!

334
19:13.600 --> 19:14.160
Jun!

335
19:14.160 --> 19:14.640
What are you doing?

336
19:14.640 --> 19:15.680
Let go of him!

337
19:16.080 --> 19:16.800
Let go!

338
19:17.440 --> 19:18.760
Jun, calm down.

339
19:18.760 --> 19:19.360
Calm down.

340
19:19.520 --> 19:21.120
Let's talk when Hu gets back.

341
19:21.200 --> 19:23.880
Why can't Xiao Longnü win the lawsuit?

342
19:24.160 --> 19:25.680
Her father is a big thug.

343
19:26.520 --> 19:27.280
Let's go.

344
19:27.600 --> 19:28.400
Son of a bitch.

345
19:49.200 --> 19:49.960
Are you okay?

346
19:50.440 --> 19:51.240
I'm fine.

347
19:51.840 --> 19:52.770
Take a few steps.

348
20:04.720 --> 20:05.520
Bear with it.

349
20:05.520 --> 20:06.920
Bro, please don't.

350
20:07.560 --> 20:08.220
Don't move.

351
20:09.440 --> 20:10.160
Bro, please don't.

352
20:10.160 --> 20:11.000
Don't move.

353
20:11.640 --> 20:13.280
Bro, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

354
20:16.080 --> 20:17.120
Stop looking. Stop looking.

355
20:17.120 --> 20:19.180
Everyone, turn around. Turn around.

356
20:19.880 --> 20:20.520
It'll be quick.

357
20:20.520 --> 20:21.520
Please don't.

358
20:26.440 --> 20:27.720
Good boy. Well done.

359
20:31.520 --> 20:32.200
Good job.

360
20:44.000 --> 20:44.930
Call the police.

361
20:45.200 --> 20:47.800
Someone got beaten up at Yuqiongge Bathhouse.

362
21:07.640 --> 21:08.400
Slow down.

363
21:09.600 --> 21:10.730
This is outrageous.

364
21:13.200 --> 21:14.280
You're too ruthless.

365
21:14.280 --> 21:16.880
Officer, look. Look at how badly he was beaten.

366
21:17.160 --> 21:18.620
The attack was too brutal.

367
21:35.600 --> 21:37.280
Long, you're awake.

368
21:38.080 --> 21:39.610
Are you feeling any better?

369
21:40.160 --> 21:41.160
I feel a bit dizzy.

370
21:41.720 --> 21:43.240
It's okay. Take your time.

371
21:43.560 --> 21:45.160
Don't think about anything.

372
21:53.520 --> 21:55.720
Xin, I'm at the hospital.

373
22:05.240 --> 22:06.040
What?

374
22:09.320 --> 22:10.120
I understand.

375
22:14.800 --> 22:15.520
Mr. Li.

376
22:17.240 --> 22:18.080
What's wrong?

377
23:01.640 --> 23:02.560
You scared me.

378
23:03.640 --> 23:04.700
What are you doing?

379
23:05.120 --> 23:07.440
I heard you rushing upstairs just now.

380
23:07.920 --> 23:10.440
Nothing. The mattress over there is too soft.

381
23:10.440 --> 23:11.600
It makes my back ache.

382
23:11.600 --> 23:13.130
So I came back for the night.

383
23:16.200 --> 23:19.200
You're still thinking about the law firm, aren't you?

384
23:21.640 --> 23:24.680
Lawyer Xiao has suffered a lot.

385
23:25.280 --> 23:28.160
With so many things going on, it breaks my heart.

386
23:29.080 --> 23:30.920
I want to cover her rent for these few months.

387
23:30.920 --> 23:31.920
Waive it for her.

388
23:32.120 --> 23:34.850
We should help as much as we can. What do you think?

389
23:35.320 --> 23:37.120
Sure, whatever you say.

390
23:41.320 --> 23:42.400
How are things

391
23:43.760 --> 23:45.360
between you and Dali lately?

392
23:45.880 --> 23:49.600
Pretty good. He's just busy with company stuff.

393
23:57.160 --> 23:58.280
Speaking of your childhood friend,

394
23:58.280 --> 24:00.160
he's really been great to you.

395
24:00.360 --> 24:02.200
He found you a good job

396
24:02.480 --> 24:04.410
and helped take care of our family.

397
24:04.480 --> 24:07.280
When will we ever be able to repay such a huge favor?

398
24:07.360 --> 24:08.960
Why are you bringing this up?

399
24:11.600 --> 24:15.280
You know, when we didn't have money before,

400
24:15.440 --> 24:19.560
I used to think about how to make big money every day.

401
24:21.440 --> 24:23.240
Now that we suddenly have money,

402
24:23.640 --> 24:25.600
I actually feel uneasy.

403
24:26.520 --> 24:28.680
I worry every day.

404
24:29.360 --> 24:30.620
Making money is so easy

405
24:31.040 --> 24:32.040
and smooth.

406
24:32.280 --> 24:34.760
Can I spend this money with peace of mind?

407
24:37.760 --> 24:38.480
Huzi.

408
24:39.400 --> 24:41.280
I never expected

409
24:41.280 --> 24:43.400
you to make a fortune.

410
24:44.080 --> 24:46.400
As long as you are safe,

411
24:46.440 --> 24:47.640
happy,

412
24:47.960 --> 24:49.400
and live an honest life,

413
24:49.960 --> 24:51.360
I'll be satisfied.

414
24:52.680 --> 24:53.360
I know.

415
24:56.280 --> 24:57.140
Are you hungry?

416
24:58.120 --> 24:58.880
I'm hungry.

417
24:59.360 --> 25:01.020
I'll cook some noodles for us.

418
25:01.520 --> 25:02.320
Wait a moment.

419
25:25.720 --> 25:26.440
Dad.

420
25:27.160 --> 25:29.090
What are you doing? Are you healed?

421
25:29.160 --> 25:30.200
Why are you here?

422
25:34.760 --> 25:36.760
I'm representing your case now.

423
25:37.240 --> 25:38.480
You don't need to worry about me.

424
25:38.480 --> 25:39.160
I caused the trouble.

425
25:39.160 --> 25:41.160
Let the court decide.

426
25:41.160 --> 25:42.920
It's just like going back for re-education.

427
25:42.920 --> 25:44.320
I'll be back in a few days.

428
25:44.720 --> 25:47.280
Dad, the current situation is

429
25:49.280 --> 25:51.480
that you might be sentenced to five years

430
25:51.480 --> 25:52.240
or more.

431
25:54.040 --> 25:56.920
The injury report shows a level six disability.

432
25:57.800 --> 26:00.040
His leg is broken.

433
26:01.600 --> 26:02.360
Impossible.

434
26:02.600 --> 26:05.240
Do you remember what happened then?

435
26:05.360 --> 26:06.280
Because that day,

436
26:06.280 --> 26:06.880
I was angry.

437
26:06.880 --> 26:07.760
After I visited you at the hospital,

438
26:07.760 --> 26:08.600
I went in.

439
26:08.600 --> 26:10.280
Then his lackeys next to him

440
26:10.280 --> 26:11.560
rushed over with sticks.

441
26:11.560 --> 26:13.440
I grabbed one and swung it.

442
26:13.840 --> 26:15.800
But I didn't hit him that hard.

443
26:17.520 --> 26:18.040
Long.

444
26:19.600 --> 26:20.800
I'm sorry.

445
26:20.800 --> 26:21.800
It's all my fault.

446
26:22.600 --> 26:24.860
If I hadn't insisted on taking this case,

447
26:24.880 --> 26:26.600
things wouldn't have turned out like this.

448
26:26.600 --> 26:27.440
No, Longlong,

449
26:27.440 --> 26:28.840
you can't say that.

450
26:28.840 --> 26:30.960
You took the case to help others.

451
26:31.680 --> 26:33.600
I hit him because I was angry.

452
26:33.600 --> 26:34.320
I just...

453
26:38.200 --> 26:39.800
I shouldn't have caused you trouble

454
26:39.800 --> 26:41.960
at such a critical time, sweetie.

455
26:42.120 --> 26:42.720
Really,

456
26:43.160 --> 26:43.960
I'm really sorry.

457
26:43.960 --> 26:45.680
Dad, don't say that.

458
26:46.400 --> 26:48.200
You have nothing to be sorry for.

459
27:02.240 --> 27:02.840
Long.

460
27:03.640 --> 27:04.240
Long.

461
27:04.640 --> 27:06.680
Jun didn't suffer too much in there, did he?

462
27:06.680 --> 27:07.120
Right.

463
27:07.120 --> 27:08.200
Xiaolong, let me know if you need money.

464
27:08.200 --> 27:09.560
I can sell the restaurant right away.

465
27:09.560 --> 27:10.360
I have some here too.

466
27:10.360 --> 27:11.560
It's fine, Uncle.

467
27:13.720 --> 27:15.560
Don't worry too much about it.

468
27:15.840 --> 27:17.100
He is my dad, after all.

469
27:17.360 --> 27:18.680
I'll figure something out.

470
27:18.680 --> 27:20.360
Long, if you need any help...

471
27:20.360 --> 27:21.000
Uncle.

472
27:21.400 --> 27:22.660
I need some time alone.

473
27:31.400 --> 27:32.280
Xin,

474
27:33.280 --> 27:34.480
tell me the truth.

475
27:35.320 --> 27:37.240
Xiaolong's family is facing such a big crisis.

476
27:37.240 --> 27:38.500
Is it directly related

477
27:39.200 --> 27:41.080
to Wan Gang?

478
27:44.200 --> 27:45.280
You and Xiaolong

479
27:46.280 --> 27:48.280
have been friends for so many years.

480
27:48.480 --> 27:50.720
Don't you want to lend a helping hand

481
27:51.320 --> 27:52.760
at a critical moment?

482
27:56.280 --> 27:59.920
You won't continue to work for Wan Gang, will you?

483
28:02.480 --> 28:04.480
There are so many people in your law firm.

484
28:04.480 --> 28:07.160
Why do you have to be the one to do this?

485
28:11.360 --> 28:12.240
Well,

486
28:15.400 --> 28:16.600
it really has to be me.

487
28:20.920 --> 28:21.520
Okay.

488
28:22.040 --> 28:23.680
Let's not argue about this.

489
28:25.920 --> 28:27.000
I know

490
28:27.000 --> 28:28.800
I've said a lot of things

491
28:29.640 --> 28:31.160
that you're tired of hearing.

492
28:31.160 --> 28:32.360
Don't worry.

493
28:32.800 --> 28:34.120
I won't

494
28:35.200 --> 28:37.520
nag you for the rest of your life.

495
28:38.920 --> 28:40.200
Dad just hopes

496
28:41.480 --> 28:43.800
that you won't regret the things you say

497
28:44.240 --> 28:45.370
and do in the future.

498
28:51.840 --> 28:53.200
I believe my son,

499
28:53.560 --> 28:54.480
deep down,

500
28:56.080 --> 28:57.680
still has a sense of justice.

501
28:59.720 --> 29:00.760
Right, Xiaolong?

502
29:03.360 --> 29:04.120
Xiaoxin.

503
29:04.720 --> 29:05.840
Right, son?

504
29:26.440 --> 29:27.080
Morning.

505
29:27.440 --> 29:28.400
Morning, Director.

506
29:28.400 --> 29:29.660
Morning, Sister Long.

507
29:29.720 --> 29:30.320
Director,

508
29:30.760 --> 29:32.280
here are some precedents

509
29:32.760 --> 29:34.480
of similar assault cases I found.

510
29:34.480 --> 29:37.210
I've also highlighted some defense strategies.

511
29:37.240 --> 29:38.970
See if they can help Uncle Xiao.

512
29:39.560 --> 29:41.290
What happened to your glasses?

513
29:41.560 --> 29:45.200
I broke them in my sleep last night.

514
29:45.440 --> 29:46.160
Sleeping?

515
29:46.160 --> 29:47.400
Sister Long, well,

516
29:47.400 --> 29:48.840
besides taking your own medicine,

517
29:48.840 --> 29:50.400
you should also take these Panax notoginseng tablets

518
29:50.400 --> 29:51.520
and Vitamin D.

519
29:51.520 --> 29:53.840
Taking them together will help you recover faster.

520
29:53.840 --> 29:56.040
Just remember to take them after meals.

521
29:56.920 --> 29:57.680
Don't move.

522
30:06.400 --> 30:07.260
What happened?

523
30:08.080 --> 30:09.440
I fell off my bike

524
30:09.440 --> 30:11.280
after work last night.

525
30:11.320 --> 30:13.160
You can fall like this from a bike?

526
30:13.160 --> 30:14.800
There was a small pebble on the road.

527
30:14.800 --> 30:16.120
I got stuck on it

528
30:16.120 --> 30:17.280
and just fell right there.

529
30:17.280 --> 30:19.280
I... She insisted on giving me a ride.

530
30:19.280 --> 30:21.560
Yeah, he insisted on riding the bike I was on.

531
30:21.560 --> 30:21.880
No.

532
30:21.880 --> 30:23.410
Don't you live downstairs?

533
30:24.720 --> 30:27.560
We went to the corner to eat Malatang.

534
30:27.680 --> 30:30.480
How can you be so... Stop making things up, you two.

535
30:32.160 --> 30:33.440
I've dragged you down.

536
30:34.920 --> 30:36.840
What are you talking about, Director?

537
30:36.840 --> 30:37.920
We are a team.

538
30:37.920 --> 30:39.440
There's no such thing as dragging anyone down.

539
30:39.440 --> 30:40.320
Exactly.

540
30:48.200 --> 30:49.080
How about this?

541
30:50.760 --> 30:51.520
Lately,

542
30:52.640 --> 30:54.440
everyone has been working hard.

543
30:55.000 --> 30:57.060
I'll give you some paid annual leave.

544
30:57.280 --> 30:58.720
Get some good rest

545
30:58.720 --> 31:00.200
and spend time with your families.

546
31:00.200 --> 31:03.000
No need. I'm not going back.

547
31:03.000 --> 31:04.920
Why take annual leave? I'm not tired.

548
31:04.920 --> 31:05.760
Gu Miaomiao,

549
31:06.520 --> 31:07.680
listen to me on this.

550
31:08.240 --> 31:09.500
I'm really not afraid.

551
31:09.800 --> 31:11.060
I'm not afraid either.

552
31:11.280 --> 31:13.720
In situations like this, we should stick together even more.

553
31:13.720 --> 31:15.380
There's strength in numbers.

554
31:15.800 --> 31:17.280
What strength?

555
31:18.440 --> 31:20.240
What strength do the three of us have?

556
31:20.240 --> 31:22.320
Today, your glasses broke.

557
31:22.320 --> 31:23.280
You got scraped.

558
31:23.280 --> 31:24.480
What about tomorrow?

559
31:24.680 --> 31:26.210
You're not afraid, but I am.

560
31:26.480 --> 31:27.920
My reach isn't that long.

561
31:27.920 --> 31:30.000
I can't protect that many people.

562
31:30.000 --> 31:32.760
If he dares to do it again, we'll call the police and have him arrested.

563
31:32.760 --> 31:34.320
Call the police, and then what?

564
31:34.320 --> 31:35.800
A bunch of them got arrested today.

565
31:35.800 --> 31:37.080
They'll be released in a few months.

566
31:37.080 --> 31:38.320
They come one after another.

567
31:38.320 --> 31:39.680
Can we withstand them?

568
31:39.800 --> 31:42.400
Are... Are you still going to take the bar exam?

569
31:43.080 --> 31:43.800
And you,

570
31:44.120 --> 31:45.000
you're a girl.

571
31:45.000 --> 31:46.600
If something happens to you,

572
31:47.320 --> 31:49.400
how can I explain it to your parents?

573
31:50.080 --> 31:50.760
I...

574
31:50.880 --> 31:53.080
Don't give me this crying act.

575
31:53.080 --> 31:54.010
I hate seeing it.

576
31:55.040 --> 31:56.100
Hurry up and leave.

577
31:58.280 --> 32:00.280
We agreed

578
32:00.280 --> 32:03.080
to make the law firm bigger and stronger together.

579
32:09.760 --> 32:11.240
I'm just incompetent.

580
32:12.840 --> 32:13.600
Alright?

581
32:16.520 --> 32:17.680
I'm begging you.

582
32:19.200 --> 32:20.040
Just go.

583
32:30.040 --> 32:32.480
She didn't mean that.

584
32:32.880 --> 32:33.520
Let's go.

585
32:51.160 --> 32:51.760
Brother.

586
32:52.960 --> 32:54.820
Mr. Wan, why did you ask me to come?

587
32:55.440 --> 32:57.760
Why do you look so haggard?

588
32:57.880 --> 32:59.600
Haven't you been sleeping well lately?

589
32:59.600 --> 33:00.560
Is that all?

590
33:04.280 --> 33:05.680
I want you to take the case

591
33:06.920 --> 33:09.960
of my brother who was injured by Xiao Jun.

592
33:14.680 --> 33:17.920
I think you have a good relationship with Xiao Longnv,

593
33:18.120 --> 33:20.320
and you are our family's legal advisor.

594
33:20.520 --> 33:23.680
After thinking about it, I don't trust anyone else.

595
33:24.720 --> 33:25.850
You are the best fit.

596
33:44.320 --> 33:46.050
Where are Luo Zhi and Miaomiao?

597
33:46.080 --> 33:47.810
I gave them their annual leave.

598
33:54.200 --> 33:55.400
How is your recovery?

599
33:56.000 --> 33:57.800
I just went to Cheng Fei's place.

600
33:58.920 --> 34:02.200
I wrote down all the precautions

601
34:02.200 --> 34:04.000
and dietary restrictions for you.

602
34:04.000 --> 34:06.360
I'll go with you to his place again tomorrow

603
34:06.360 --> 34:08.090
so we can do a thorough checkup.

604
34:09.280 --> 34:11.440
No need. I'm fine.

605
34:12.760 --> 34:14.560
Just tell me what's on your mind.

606
34:27.120 --> 34:28.360
I met with Wan Zhuoli.

607
34:30.880 --> 34:32.800
What? Are you feeling torn

608
34:33.679 --> 34:35.600
because Xiao Jun is

609
34:35.840 --> 34:37.100
Xiao Longnv's father?

610
34:38.080 --> 34:39.739
He said for Uncle Xiao's case,

611
34:40.199 --> 34:43.260
I can have my subordinate issue a letter of forgiveness

612
34:43.480 --> 34:45.679
and waive the financial compensation,

613
34:47.880 --> 34:49.280
but there's a condition.

614
34:50.199 --> 34:53.080
As long as Xiao Longnv stops bothering Wan Gang,

615
34:53.080 --> 34:56.340
as for the lawsuit between the farmers and Fuyuan Village,

616
34:56.719 --> 34:58.380
he hopes you can drop the case.

617
35:07.880 --> 35:08.600
Got it.

618
35:09.920 --> 35:11.160
I'll think about it.

619
35:18.520 --> 35:19.240
Xiaolong.

620
35:20.920 --> 35:22.850
This will definitely be resolved.

621
35:23.920 --> 35:24.480
Sure.

622
35:24.560 --> 35:26.400
But we need to sign

623
35:26.400 --> 35:27.930
a formal agency agreement.

624
35:28.200 --> 35:29.760
Alright, let's sign it.

625
35:30.960 --> 35:31.880
Trust me.

626
35:57.040 --> 35:59.440
Is Brother Jun's situation really that serious?

627
35:59.440 --> 36:01.800
The injured person is your childhood friend's man.

628
36:01.800 --> 36:03.730
Shouldn't you know better than me?

629
36:03.880 --> 36:05.680
I'll go back and beg Dali right now.

630
36:05.680 --> 36:06.720
I'll beg him to let Brother Jun go.

631
36:06.720 --> 36:07.980
Is it useful to beg him?

632
36:08.520 --> 36:09.780
It will only backfire.

633
36:11.640 --> 36:12.900
Then what should we do?

634
36:18.240 --> 36:19.920
I thought you had a lot of ideas.

635
36:19.920 --> 36:21.240
Are you just posing?

636
36:29.360 --> 36:31.220
You finally decided to come back.

637
36:36.840 --> 36:38.040
Because of a lawsuit,

638
36:38.160 --> 36:40.080
you've ruined their family.

639
36:41.480 --> 36:42.320
What?

640
36:42.880 --> 36:44.640
You want to beat me up too?

641
36:47.040 --> 36:48.200
I wanted to.

642
36:55.440 --> 36:56.320
Honest enough.

643
36:59.040 --> 37:01.120
Seems you still treat me as a brother.

644
37:02.240 --> 37:02.920
Dali.

645
37:04.560 --> 37:05.820
Since we are brothers,

646
37:07.440 --> 37:08.480
I beg you.

647
37:09.960 --> 37:11.890
Let Brother Jun off the hook, okay?

648
37:12.240 --> 37:13.370
That's impossible.

649
37:15.120 --> 37:16.320
You are my brother.

650
37:16.920 --> 37:19.320
And the one who got beaten is also my brother.

651
37:19.320 --> 37:20.400
If it were you,

652
37:21.040 --> 37:22.300
could I just ignore it?

653
37:35.800 --> 37:37.480
All right, this is not up for discussion.

654
37:37.480 --> 37:38.480
Since you're back,

655
37:38.480 --> 37:39.680
go out and take a look.

656
37:40.240 --> 37:42.360
This shop can't run without you.

657
38:00.160 --> 38:00.640
Dad Li.

658
38:01.240 --> 38:01.970
You're back.

659
38:02.320 --> 38:02.850
Hurry up.

660
38:03.720 --> 38:05.050
Wipe your hands and eat.

661
38:05.840 --> 38:07.880
You don't have to come over just to cook for me.

662
38:07.880 --> 38:09.800
Why are you being so polite with me?

663
38:09.800 --> 38:11.880
Just focus on recovering from your injuries.

664
38:11.880 --> 38:14.280
If anything happens, Dad Li is here for you.

665
38:25.920 --> 38:27.180
How is Xiaolong doing?

666
38:30.600 --> 38:32.440
He's recovering okay.

667
38:32.480 --> 38:34.540
But he just doesn't have much energy.

668
38:34.600 --> 38:36.960
If Xiaolong hadn't left Honghu back then,

669
38:37.720 --> 38:40.120
things wouldn't have turned out like this.

670
38:44.960 --> 38:47.560
Attorney Xiao, are you feeling better?

671
38:48.360 --> 38:49.520
I heard about what happened.

672
38:49.520 --> 38:51.400
If it's too hard, let's drop the lawsuit.

673
38:51.400 --> 38:53.920
I'll still pay your legal fees.

674
38:54.440 --> 38:55.320
People...

675
38:55.520 --> 38:58.580
Sometimes they have to learn to make the right choices.

676
38:59.120 --> 39:02.680
I just want Honghu to establish a foothold in Leyang.

677
39:02.840 --> 39:03.640
And you

678
39:05.080 --> 39:06.360
can make it go further.

679
39:12.160 --> 39:14.800
Congratulations to Xingang Chemical Energy Group Co., Ltd.

680
39:14.800 --> 39:16.330
on the successful signing.

681
39:27.560 --> 39:29.960
Drawing high attention from the industry.

682
40:16.720 --> 40:18.080
Besides, whose daughter am I?

683
40:18.080 --> 40:19.480
Could Lao Xiao's daughter get into trouble?

684
40:19.480 --> 40:20.920
No, no matter how old you are,

685
40:20.920 --> 40:22.560
you are Lao Xiao's child.

686
40:22.560 --> 40:25.620
Lao Xiao has a responsibility to protect you, you know?

687
41:55.480 --> 41:57.200
Dad, good news.

688
41:57.200 --> 41:57.920
What is it?

689
41:58.600 --> 42:00.560
Our case has a turnaround.

690
42:01.280 --> 42:04.040
They are willing to issue a letter of forgiveness.

691
42:04.040 --> 42:06.440
And we don't even have to pay the medical bills.

692
42:06.440 --> 42:07.640
How is that possible?

693
42:07.880 --> 42:08.640
It's true.

694
42:10.280 --> 42:11.410
Did they come to you?

695
42:13.640 --> 42:14.880
What's the catch?

696
42:15.200 --> 42:16.840
No, there's no catch.

697
42:16.960 --> 42:18.720
Okay, don't lie to me.

698
42:19.000 --> 42:20.600
I've been around the block for years.

699
42:20.600 --> 42:21.880
You can't fool me with this kind of thing.

700
42:21.880 --> 42:22.200
What's wrong?

701
42:22.200 --> 42:24.760
Did they tell you not to represent Old Pan?

702
42:26.040 --> 42:27.280
It's not them.

703
42:27.800 --> 42:29.200
I thought about it.

704
42:30.080 --> 42:32.320
The case isn't going

705
42:33.480 --> 42:34.610
smoothly right now.

706
42:36.200 --> 42:37.280
Besides,

707
42:38.480 --> 42:40.680
we probably won't win the second trial.

708
42:40.920 --> 42:43.450
And the law firm's business is being delayed.

709
42:44.000 --> 42:45.040
So,

710
42:47.840 --> 42:49.720
I just want to give up.

711
42:50.520 --> 42:52.680
If I give up,

712
42:53.640 --> 42:54.680
it'll be good for everyone.
